# Project OS architecture

- Keep **Domain / Application / Infrastructure** boundaries. Domain has no WordPress imports.
- Prefix globals and hooks with `avs_`. Namespace `AnvisionStudio\ProjectOS`.
- **Never trust client money totals** — recalculate from line items in Application/Domain.
- Idempotency-Key: replay on match, **409** on key reuse with different body fingerprint.
- Quotation snapshots are immutable; mutations go through new versions only.
- Review changes must use the state machine and append audit log entries.
